    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{a-9}{a-3}$, $a\\ne0,3$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{a^2-9a}{a(a-3)}&=\\frac{a(a-9)}{a(a-3)}\\\\\\frac{a^2-9a}{a(a-3)}&=\\frac{a-9}{a-3}\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $a\\ne0,3$.",
